WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From a squat, twist the torso and hook the upper arm across the outer knee.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Plant both hands on the floor to one side, shoulder-width apart.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Bend the elbows slightly and rest the outer hip on the upper arms.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Shift weight forward and lift the toes off the floor.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, breathing steadily, then lower with control and switch sides.
